### 2 failing tests — could not confirm directly

**Blocker:** Vanta UI is gated behind login. `slay tasks browser` requires the task tab to be active in slay (returns "Browser panel did not open within timeout. Is the task tab active?"). chrome-devtools MCP is off-limits per user direction.

Given the existing policy, procedure, weekly DAST cadence, and risk-acceptance practice, the failing 2/17 are NOT about missing controls. Most likely candidates (verify in UI):

1. **Open Critical/High alert past SLA** — Vanta auto-fails if a GitHub Security alert is open beyond Ops Sec Policy SLA (Critical >30d, High >60d). Tied to siblings #11 / #29.
2. **Stale evidence upload** — Vanta wants periodic upload of scan output (ZAP report PDF / pen test) and the previously-uploaded artifact has aged out.

